  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SCTP activities Integrated Social</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building upon the 3-years of UNICEF - Embassy of Ireland partnership (2019-2022), this follow on grant will further strengthen the capacity of the MSCTP staff with a focus on Balaka and Ntcheu, as well as contributing to the broader MNSSP II implementation. Additionally, the support will contribute to social support policy development and coordination, and overall design improvements of the MSCTP, including its sensitivity to shocks, categorical targeting approaches, and the scale-up of harmonised payment systems.</narrative>
  </description>
